:: Sleep
Sleep for how long?

<<link "Sleep for 1 hour" "Sleep">><<incrementTime 1 0>><</link>>
<<link "Sleep for 2 hours" "Sleep">><<incrementTime 2 0>><</link>>
<<link "Sleep for 3 hours" "Sleep">><<incrementTime 3 0>><</link>>
